{"suttaId":"an5.69","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-v","vriCode":"s0403m1.mul","paras":[558,559],"vripara":"69"},"segments":{"an5.69:0.3":"Nibbidāsuttaṃ","an5.69:1.1":"“Pañcime, bhikkhave, dhammā bhāvitā bahulīkatā ekantanibbidāya virāgāya nirodhāya upasamāya abhiññāya sambodhāya nibbānāya saṃvattanti.","an5.69:2.1":"“Katame pañca?","an5.69:2.2":"Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu asubhānupassī kāye viharati, āhāre paṭikūlasaññī, sabbaloke anabhiratasaññī [anabhiratisaññī (ka.) a. ni. 5.121-122, 303-304 passitabbaṃ], sabbasaṅkhāresu aniccānupassī, maraṇasaññā kho panassa ajjhattaṃ sūpaṭṭhitā hoti.","an5.69:2.3":"Ime kho, bhikkhave, pañca dhammā bhāvitā bahulīkatā ekantanibbidāya virāgāya nirodhāya upasamāya abhiññāya sambodhāya nibbānāya saṃvattantī”ti.","an5.69:2.4":"Navamaṃ. 10."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-v","bookName":"Pañcakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0403a.att","from":162,"to":165,"paras":[{"para":162,"vripara":"67-70","refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Sattame <b>ussoḷhī</b>ti adhimattavīriyaṃ.","Aṭṭhame attano bodhimaṇḍe paṭividdhe āgamanaiddhipāde kathetvā upari attanova cha abhiññā kathesīti.","Navamadasamesu vipassanā kathitā.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"],["an5.69:1"],["an5.69:1"],["an5.69:1"]]},{"para":163,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Saññāvaggo dutiyo. (8) 3."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"]]},{"para":164,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Yodhājīvavaggo 1."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"]]},{"para":165,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Paṭhamacetovimuttiphalasuttavaṇṇanā 71."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-v","bookName":"Pañcakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":161,"to":165,"paras":[{"para":161,"vripara":"66-70","refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Chaṭṭhe saha ājīvanti etthāti <b>sājīvo,</b> pañhassa pucchanaṃ vissajjanañca.","Tenāha <b>“sājīvoti pañhapucchanañceva pañhavissajjanañcā”</b>tiādi.","<b>Abhisaṅkhata</b>nti citaṃ.","Sattamādīni uttānatthāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"],["an5.69:1"],["an5.69:1"],["an5.69:1"]]},{"para":162,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Sājīvasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"]]},{"para":163,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Saññāvaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. (8) 3."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"]]},{"para":164,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Yodhājīvavaggo 1-2."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"]]},{"para":165,"vripara":null,"refs":["an5.69:1"],"lines":["Paṭhamacetovimuttiphalasuttādivaṇṇanā 71-72."],"lineRefs":[["an5.69:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
